{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack AI now ships a first-party Cloudflare adapter, "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/ai-cloudflare"},{"type":"text","value":". See the "},{"type":"link","href":"../adapters/cloudflare","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Cloudflare adapter"}]},{"type":"text","value":" page. This page covers Cloudflare's own "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai"},{"type":"text","value":" package."}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The Cloudflare adapter provides access to "},{"type":"link","href":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Cloudflare Workers AI"}]},{"type":"text","value":" models and "},{"type":"link","href":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/ai-gateway/","children":[{"type":"text","value":"AI Gateway"}]},{"type":"text","value":" for routing requests to OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Grok, and OpenRouter with caching, rate limiting, and unified billing."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"installation","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Installation"}]},{"type":"component","name":"tabs","attributes":{"variant":"package-manager","mode":"install"},"children":[],"properties":{"data-package-manager-meta":"{\"packagesByFramework\":{\"react\":[[\"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\",\"@tanstack/ai\"]],\"vue\":[[\"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\",\"@tanstack/ai\"]],\"solid\":[[\"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\",\"@tanstack/ai\"]],\"svelte\":[[\"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\",\"@tanstack/ai\"]],\"preact\":[[\"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\",\"@tanstack/ai\"]],\"angular\":[[\"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\",\"@tanstack/ai\"]],\"vanilla\":[[\"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\",\"@tanstack/ai\"]],\"octane\":[[\"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\",\"@tanstack/ai\"]]},\"mode\":\"install\"}"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"For AI Gateway with third-party providers, install the provider SDKs you need:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"tabs","attributes":{"variant":"package-manager","mode":"install"},"children":[],"properties":{"data-package-manager-meta":"{\"packagesByFramework\":{\"react\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-openai\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-anthropic\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-gemini\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-grok\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-openrouter\"]],\"vue\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-openai\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-anthropic\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-gemini\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-grok\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-openrouter\"]],\"solid\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-openai\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-anthropic\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-gemini\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-grok\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-openrouter\"]],\"svelte\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-openai\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-anthropic\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-gemini\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-grok\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-openrouter\"]],\"preact\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-openai\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-anthropic\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-gemini\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-grok\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-openrouter\"]],\"angular\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-openai\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-anthropic\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-gemini\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-grok\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-openrouter\"]],\"vanilla\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-openai\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-anthropic\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-gemini\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-grok\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-openrouter\"]],\"octane\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-openai\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-anthropic\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-gemini\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-grok\"],[\"@tanstack/ai-openrouter\"]]},\"mode\":\"install\"}"}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"basic-usage","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Basic Usage"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { chat, toHttpResponse } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createWorkersAiChat } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter = createWorkersAiChat(\n  \"@cf/meta/llama-4-scout-17b-16e-instruct\",\n  { binding: env.AI },\n);\n\nconst response = chat({\n  adapter,\n  stream: true,\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello!\" }],\n});\n\nconst httpResponse = toHttpResponse(response);","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"workers-ai","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Workers AI"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The simplest way to use AI in a Cloudflare Worker. No API keys needed when using the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"env.AI"},{"type":"text","value":" binding."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"chat","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Chat"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { chat, toHttpResponse } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createWorkersAiChat } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter = createWorkersAiChat(\n  \"@cf/meta/llama-4-scout-17b-16e-instruct\",\n  { binding: env.AI },\n);\n\nconst response = chat({\n  adapter,\n  stream: true,\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello!\" }],\n});\n\nconst httpResponse = toHttpResponse(response);","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"chat-with-rest-credentials","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Chat with REST Credentials"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If you're not running inside a Worker, use account ID and API key instead:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createWorkersAiChat } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\n\nconst adapter = createWorkersAiChat(\n  \"@cf/meta/llama-4-scout-17b-16e-instruct\",\n  {\n    accountId: \"your-account-id\",\n    apiKey: \"your-api-key\",\n  },\n);","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"image-generation","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Image Generation"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { generateImage } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createWorkersAiImage } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter = createWorkersAiImage(\n  \"@cf/stabilityai/stable-diffusion-xl-base-1.0\",\n  { binding: env.AI },\n);\n\nconst result = await generateImage({\n  adapter,\n  prompt: \"a cat in space\",\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.images[0]?.b64Json);","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"transcription-speech-to-text","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Transcription (Speech-to-Text)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Supports Whisper and Deepgram models:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { generateTranscription } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createWorkersAiTranscription } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env, audioArrayBuffer } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter = createWorkersAiTranscription(\n  \"@cf/openai/whisper-large-v3-turbo\",\n  { binding: env.AI },\n);\n\nconst result = await generateTranscription({\n  adapter,\n  audio: audioArrayBuffer,\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.text);\nconsole.log(result.segments);","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Supported transcription models: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@cf/openai/whisper"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@cf/openai/whisper-tiny-en"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@cf/openai/whisper-large-v3-turbo"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@cf/deepgram/nova-3"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"text-to-speech","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Text-to-Speech"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { generateSpeech } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createWorkersAiTts } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter = createWorkersAiTts(\"@cf/deepgram/aura-2-en\", {\n  binding: env.AI,\n});\n\nconst result = await generateSpeech({\n  adapter,\n  text: \"Hello world\",\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.audio);","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"summarization","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Summarization"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { summarize, type AnySummarizeAdapter } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createWorkersAiSummarize } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter: AnySummarizeAdapter = createWorkersAiSummarize(\"@cf/facebook/bart-large-cnn\", {\n  binding: env.AI,\n});\n\nconst result = await summarize({\n  adapter,\n  text: \"Long article here...\",\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.summary);","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"ai-gateway","children":[{"type":"text","value":"AI Gateway"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Route AI requests through Cloudflare's AI Gateway for caching, rate limiting, and unified billing. Supports both Workers AI and third-party providers."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"workers-ai-through-gateway","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Workers AI through Gateway"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createWorkersAiChat } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter = createWorkersAiChat(\n  \"@cf/meta/llama-4-scout-17b-16e-instruct\",\n  {\n    binding: env.AI.gateway(\"my-gateway-id\"),\n    apiKey: env.WORKERS_AI_TOKEN,\n  },\n);","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"third-party-providers-through-gateway","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Third-Party Providers through Gateway"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use the binding approach (recommended for Cloudflare Workers):"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import {\n  createOpenAiChat,\n  createAnthropicChat,\n  createGeminiChat,\n  createGrokChat,\n  createOpenRouterChat,\n} from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst openai = createOpenAiChat(\"gpt-4o\", {\n  binding: env.AI.gateway(\"my-gateway-id\"),\n});\n\nconst anthropic = createAnthropicChat(\"claude-sonnet-4-5\", {\n  binding: env.AI.gateway(\"my-gateway-id\"),\n});\n\nconst grok = createGrokChat(\"grok-4.3\", {\n  binding: env.AI.gateway(\"my-gateway-id\"),\n});\n\nconst openrouter = createOpenRouterChat(\"openai/gpt-4o\", {\n  binding: env.AI.gateway(\"my-gateway-id\"),\n});","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Or use credentials for non-Worker environments:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createOpenAiChat } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\n\nconst adapter = createOpenAiChat(\"gpt-4o\", {\n  accountId: \"your-account-id\",\n  gatewayId: \"your-gateway-id\",\n  cfApiKey: \"your-cf-api-key\",\n  apiKey: \"provider-api-key\",\n});","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"cache-options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Cache Options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Both binding and credentials modes support cache configuration:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createOpenAiChat } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter = createOpenAiChat(\"gpt-4o\", {\n  binding: env.AI.gateway(\"my-gateway-id\"),\n  skipCache: false,\n  cacheTtl: 3600,\n  customCacheKey: \"my-key\",\n  metadata: { user: \"test\" },\n});","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"configuration-modes","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configuration Modes"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Workers AI supports four configuration modes:"}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Mode"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Config"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Description"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Plain binding"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{ binding: env.AI }"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Direct access, no gateway"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Plain REST"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{ accountId, apiKey }"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"REST API, no gateway"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Gateway binding"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{ binding: env.AI.gateway(id) }"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Through AI Gateway via binding"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Gateway REST"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{ accountId, gatewayId, ... }"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Through AI Gateway via REST"}]}]]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Third-party providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Grok, OpenRouter) only support the gateway modes."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"supported-capabilities","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Supported Capabilities"}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null,null,null,null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Provider"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Chat"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Summarize"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Image Gen"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Transcription"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TTS"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Workers AI"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"OpenAI"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Anthropic"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"❌"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"❌"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"❌"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Gemini"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"❌"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Grok"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"❌"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"❌"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"OpenRouter"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"❌"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"❌"}]}]]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"environment-variables","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Environment Variables"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"For the REST credential path (outside of Cloudflare Workers):"}]},{"type":"code","value":"CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=your-account-id\nCLOUDFLARE_API_KEY=your-api-key","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"When using the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"env.AI"},{"type":"text","value":" binding inside a Worker, no environment variables are needed."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"api-reference","children":[{"type":"text","value":"API Reference"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"workers-ai-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Workers AI"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createWorkersAiChat(model, config)"},{"type":"text","value":" — Chat and structured output"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createWorkersAiImage(model, config)"},{"type":"text","value":" — Image generation"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createWorkersAiTranscription(model, config)"},{"type":"text","value":" — Speech-to-text (Whisper, Deepgram)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createWorkersAiTts(model, config)"},{"type":"text","value":" — Text-to-speech (Deepgram Aura)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createWorkersAiSummarize(model, config)"},{"type":"text","value":" — Summarization (BART-large-CNN)"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"gateway-providers","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Gateway Providers"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createOpenAiChat(model, config)"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createOpenAiSummarize"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createOpenAiImage"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createOpenAiTranscription"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createOpenAiTts"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createAnthropicChat(model, config)"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createAnthropicSummarize"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createGeminiChat(model, config)"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createGeminiSummarize"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createGeminiImage"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createGeminiTts"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createGrokChat(model, config)"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createGrokSummarize"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createGrokImage"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createOpenRouterChat(model, config)"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createOpenRouterSummarize"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createOpenRouterImage"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"next-steps","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Next Steps"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Cloudflare Workers AI"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — Workers AI documentation"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/ai-gateway/","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Cloudflare AI Gateway"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — AI Gateway documentation"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/cloudflare/ai","children":[{"type":"text","value":"GitHub Repository"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — Source code and issues"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../chat/streaming","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Streaming Guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — Learn about streaming responses"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../tools/tools","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tools Guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — Learn about tool calling"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"installation","text":"Installation","level":2},{"id":"basic-usage","text":"Basic Usage","level":2},{"id":"workers-ai","text":"Workers AI","level":2},{"id":"chat","text":"Chat","level":3},{"id":"chat-with-rest-credentials","text":"Chat with REST Credentials","level":3},{"id":"image-generation","text":"Image Generation","level":3},{"id":"transcription-speech-to-text","text":"Transcription (Speech-to-Text)","level":3},{"id":"text-to-speech","text":"Text-to-Speech","level":3},{"id":"summarization","text":"Summarization","level":3},{"id":"ai-gateway","text":"AI Gateway","level":2},{"id":"workers-ai-through-gateway","text":"Workers AI through Gateway","level":3},{"id":"third-party-providers-through-gateway","text":"Third-Party Providers through Gateway","level":3},{"id":"cache-options","text":"Cache Options","level":3},{"id":"configuration-modes","text":"Configuration Modes","level":2},{"id":"supported-capabilities","text":"Supported Capabilities","level":2},{"id":"environment-variables","text":"Environment Variables","level":2},{"id":"api-reference","text":"API Reference","level":2},{"id":"workers-ai-2","text":"Workers AI","level":3},{"id":"gateway-providers","text":"Gateway Providers","level":3},{"id":"next-steps","text":"Next Steps","level":2}]},"frameworks":["react","vue","solid","svelte","preact","angular","vanilla","octane"],"downloadMarkdown":"\n> TanStack AI now ships a first-party Cloudflare adapter, `@tanstack/ai-cloudflare`. See the [Cloudflare adapter](../adapters/cloudflare) page. This page covers Cloudflare's own `@cloudflare/tanstack-ai` package.\n\nThe Cloudflare adapter provides access to [Cloudflare Workers AI](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/) models and [AI Gateway](https://developers.cloudflare.com/ai-gateway/) for routing requests to OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Grok, and OpenRouter with caching, rate limiting, and unified billing.\n\n## Installation\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" mode=\"install\" -->\n\nreact: @cloudflare/tanstack-ai @tanstack/ai\nvue: @cloudflare/tanstack-ai @tanstack/ai\nsolid: @cloudflare/tanstack-ai @tanstack/ai\nsvelte: @cloudflare/tanstack-ai @tanstack/ai\npreact: @cloudflare/tanstack-ai @tanstack/ai\nangular: @cloudflare/tanstack-ai @tanstack/ai\nvanilla: @cloudflare/tanstack-ai @tanstack/ai\noctane: @cloudflare/tanstack-ai @tanstack/ai\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\nFor AI Gateway with third-party providers, install the provider SDKs you need:\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" mode=\"install\" -->\n\nreact: @tanstack/ai-openai\nreact: @tanstack/ai-anthropic\nreact: @tanstack/ai-gemini\nreact: @tanstack/ai-grok\nreact: @tanstack/ai-openrouter\nvue: @tanstack/ai-openai\nvue: @tanstack/ai-anthropic\nvue: @tanstack/ai-gemini\nvue: @tanstack/ai-grok\nvue: @tanstack/ai-openrouter\nsolid: @tanstack/ai-openai\nsolid: @tanstack/ai-anthropic\nsolid: @tanstack/ai-gemini\nsolid: @tanstack/ai-grok\nsolid: @tanstack/ai-openrouter\nsvelte: @tanstack/ai-openai\nsvelte: @tanstack/ai-anthropic\nsvelte: @tanstack/ai-gemini\nsvelte: @tanstack/ai-grok\nsvelte: @tanstack/ai-openrouter\npreact: @tanstack/ai-openai\npreact: @tanstack/ai-anthropic\npreact: @tanstack/ai-gemini\npreact: @tanstack/ai-grok\npreact: @tanstack/ai-openrouter\nangular: @tanstack/ai-openai\nangular: @tanstack/ai-anthropic\nangular: @tanstack/ai-gemini\nangular: @tanstack/ai-grok\nangular: @tanstack/ai-openrouter\nvanilla: @tanstack/ai-openai\nvanilla: @tanstack/ai-anthropic\nvanilla: @tanstack/ai-gemini\nvanilla: @tanstack/ai-grok\nvanilla: @tanstack/ai-openrouter\noctane: @tanstack/ai-openai\noctane: @tanstack/ai-anthropic\noctane: @tanstack/ai-gemini\noctane: @tanstack/ai-grok\noctane: @tanstack/ai-openrouter\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat, toHttpResponse } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createWorkersAiChat } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter = createWorkersAiChat(\n  \"@cf/meta/llama-4-scout-17b-16e-instruct\",\n  { binding: env.AI },\n);\n\nconst response = chat({\n  adapter,\n  stream: true,\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello!\" }],\n});\n\nconst httpResponse = toHttpResponse(response);\n```\n\n## Workers AI\n\nThe simplest way to use AI in a Cloudflare Worker. No API keys needed when using the `env.AI` binding.\n\n### Chat\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat, toHttpResponse } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createWorkersAiChat } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter = createWorkersAiChat(\n  \"@cf/meta/llama-4-scout-17b-16e-instruct\",\n  { binding: env.AI },\n);\n\nconst response = chat({\n  adapter,\n  stream: true,\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello!\" }],\n});\n\nconst httpResponse = toHttpResponse(response);\n```\n\n### Chat with REST Credentials\n\nIf you're not running inside a Worker, use account ID and API key instead:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createWorkersAiChat } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\n\nconst adapter = createWorkersAiChat(\n  \"@cf/meta/llama-4-scout-17b-16e-instruct\",\n  {\n    accountId: \"your-account-id\",\n    apiKey: \"your-api-key\",\n  },\n);\n```\n\n### Image Generation\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateImage } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createWorkersAiImage } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter = createWorkersAiImage(\n  \"@cf/stabilityai/stable-diffusion-xl-base-1.0\",\n  { binding: env.AI },\n);\n\nconst result = await generateImage({\n  adapter,\n  prompt: \"a cat in space\",\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.images[0]?.b64Json);\n```\n\n### Transcription (Speech-to-Text)\n\nSupports Whisper and Deepgram models:\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateTranscription } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createWorkersAiTranscription } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env, audioArrayBuffer } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter = createWorkersAiTranscription(\n  \"@cf/openai/whisper-large-v3-turbo\",\n  { binding: env.AI },\n);\n\nconst result = await generateTranscription({\n  adapter,\n  audio: audioArrayBuffer,\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.text);\nconsole.log(result.segments);\n```\n\nSupported transcription models: `@cf/openai/whisper`, `@cf/openai/whisper-tiny-en`, `@cf/openai/whisper-large-v3-turbo`, `@cf/deepgram/nova-3`\n\n### Text-to-Speech\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateSpeech } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createWorkersAiTts } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter = createWorkersAiTts(\"@cf/deepgram/aura-2-en\", {\n  binding: env.AI,\n});\n\nconst result = await generateSpeech({\n  adapter,\n  text: \"Hello world\",\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.audio);\n```\n\n### Summarization\n\n```typescript\nimport { summarize, type AnySummarizeAdapter } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createWorkersAiSummarize } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter: AnySummarizeAdapter = createWorkersAiSummarize(\"@cf/facebook/bart-large-cnn\", {\n  binding: env.AI,\n});\n\nconst result = await summarize({\n  adapter,\n  text: \"Long article here...\",\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.summary);\n```\n\n## AI Gateway\n\nRoute AI requests through Cloudflare's AI Gateway for caching, rate limiting, and unified billing. Supports both Workers AI and third-party providers.\n\n### Workers AI through Gateway\n\n```typescript\nimport { createWorkersAiChat } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter = createWorkersAiChat(\n  \"@cf/meta/llama-4-scout-17b-16e-instruct\",\n  {\n    binding: env.AI.gateway(\"my-gateway-id\"),\n    apiKey: env.WORKERS_AI_TOKEN,\n  },\n);\n```\n\n### Third-Party Providers through Gateway\n\nUse the binding approach (recommended for Cloudflare Workers):\n\n```typescript\nimport {\n  createOpenAiChat,\n  createAnthropicChat,\n  createGeminiChat,\n  createGrokChat,\n  createOpenRouterChat,\n} from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst openai = createOpenAiChat(\"gpt-4o\", {\n  binding: env.AI.gateway(\"my-gateway-id\"),\n});\n\nconst anthropic = createAnthropicChat(\"claude-sonnet-4-5\", {\n  binding: env.AI.gateway(\"my-gateway-id\"),\n});\n\nconst grok = createGrokChat(\"grok-4.3\", {\n  binding: env.AI.gateway(\"my-gateway-id\"),\n});\n\nconst openrouter = createOpenRouterChat(\"openai/gpt-4o\", {\n  binding: env.AI.gateway(\"my-gateway-id\"),\n});\n```\n\nOr use credentials for non-Worker environments:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createOpenAiChat } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\n\nconst adapter = createOpenAiChat(\"gpt-4o\", {\n  accountId: \"your-account-id\",\n  gatewayId: \"your-gateway-id\",\n  cfApiKey: \"your-cf-api-key\",\n  apiKey: \"provider-api-key\",\n});\n```\n\n### Cache Options\n\nBoth binding and credentials modes support cache configuration:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createOpenAiChat } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter = createOpenAiChat(\"gpt-4o\", {\n  binding: env.AI.gateway(\"my-gateway-id\"),\n  skipCache: false,\n  cacheTtl: 3600,\n  customCacheKey: \"my-key\",\n  metadata: { user: \"test\" },\n});\n```\n\n## Configuration Modes\n\nWorkers AI supports four configuration modes:\n\n| Mode | Config | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| Plain binding | `{ binding: env.AI }` | Direct access, no gateway |\n| Plain REST | `{ accountId, apiKey }` | REST API, no gateway |\n| Gateway binding | `{ binding: env.AI.gateway(id) }` | Through AI Gateway via binding |\n| Gateway REST | `{ accountId, gatewayId, ... }` | Through AI Gateway via REST |\n\nThird-party providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Grok, OpenRouter) only support the gateway modes.\n\n## Supported Capabilities\n\n| Provider | Chat | Summarize | Image Gen | Transcription | TTS |\n|----------|------|-----------|-----------|---------------|-----|\n| **Workers AI** | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| **OpenAI** | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| **Anthropic** | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |\n| **Gemini** | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ✅ |\n| **Grok** | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |\n| **OpenRouter** | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |\n\n## Environment Variables\n\nFor the REST credential path (outside of Cloudflare Workers):\n\n```bash\nCLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=your-account-id\nCLOUDFLARE_API_KEY=your-api-key\n```\n\nWhen using the `env.AI` binding inside a Worker, no environment variables are needed.\n\n## API Reference\n\n### Workers AI\n\n- `createWorkersAiChat(model, config)` — Chat and structured output\n- `createWorkersAiImage(model, config)` — Image generation\n- `createWorkersAiTranscription(model, config)` — Speech-to-text (Whisper, Deepgram)\n- `createWorkersAiTts(model, config)` — Text-to-speech (Deepgram Aura)\n- `createWorkersAiSummarize(model, config)` — Summarization (BART-large-CNN)\n\n### Gateway Providers\n\n- `createOpenAiChat(model, config)` / `createOpenAiSummarize` / `createOpenAiImage` / `createOpenAiTranscription` / `createOpenAiTts`\n- `createAnthropicChat(model, config)` / `createAnthropicSummarize`\n- `createGeminiChat(model, config)` / `createGeminiSummarize` / `createGeminiImage` / `createGeminiTts`\n- `createGrokChat(model, config)` / `createGrokSummarize` / `createGrokImage`\n- `createOpenRouterChat(model, config)` / `createOpenRouterSummarize` / `createOpenRouterImage`\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- [Cloudflare Workers AI](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/) — Workers AI documentation\n- [Cloudflare AI Gateway](https://developers.cloudflare.com/ai-gateway/) — AI Gateway documentation\n- [GitHub Repository](https://github.com/cloudflare/ai) — Source code and issues\n- [Streaming Guide](../chat/streaming) — Learn about streaming responses\n- [Tools Guide](../tools/tools) — Learn about tool calling\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Cloudflare\nid: cloudflare-adapter\norder: 3\ndescription: \"Use Cloudflare Workers AI and AI Gateway with TanStack AI for edge inference, caching, rate limiting, and unified billing across providers.\"\nkeywords:\n  - tanstack ai\n  - cloudflare\n  - workers ai\n  - ai gateway\n  - edge inference\n  - caching\n  - rate limiting\n  - community adapter\n---\n\n> TanStack AI now ships a first-party Cloudflare adapter, `@tanstack/ai-cloudflare`. See the [Cloudflare adapter](../adapters/cloudflare) page. This page covers Cloudflare's own `@cloudflare/tanstack-ai` package.\n\nThe Cloudflare adapter provides access to [Cloudflare Workers AI](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/) models and [AI Gateway](https://developers.cloudflare.com/ai-gateway/) for routing requests to OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Grok, and OpenRouter with caching, rate limiting, and unified billing.\n\n## Installation\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" mode=\"install\" -->\n\nreact: @cloudflare/tanstack-ai @tanstack/ai\nvue: @cloudflare/tanstack-ai @tanstack/ai\nsolid: @cloudflare/tanstack-ai @tanstack/ai\nsvelte: @cloudflare/tanstack-ai @tanstack/ai\npreact: @cloudflare/tanstack-ai @tanstack/ai\nangular: @cloudflare/tanstack-ai @tanstack/ai\nvanilla: @cloudflare/tanstack-ai @tanstack/ai\noctane: @cloudflare/tanstack-ai @tanstack/ai\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\nFor AI Gateway with third-party providers, install the provider SDKs you need:\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" mode=\"install\" -->\n\nreact: @tanstack/ai-openai\nreact: @tanstack/ai-anthropic\nreact: @tanstack/ai-gemini\nreact: @tanstack/ai-grok\nreact: @tanstack/ai-openrouter\nvue: @tanstack/ai-openai\nvue: @tanstack/ai-anthropic\nvue: @tanstack/ai-gemini\nvue: @tanstack/ai-grok\nvue: @tanstack/ai-openrouter\nsolid: @tanstack/ai-openai\nsolid: @tanstack/ai-anthropic\nsolid: @tanstack/ai-gemini\nsolid: @tanstack/ai-grok\nsolid: @tanstack/ai-openrouter\nsvelte: @tanstack/ai-openai\nsvelte: @tanstack/ai-anthropic\nsvelte: @tanstack/ai-gemini\nsvelte: @tanstack/ai-grok\nsvelte: @tanstack/ai-openrouter\npreact: @tanstack/ai-openai\npreact: @tanstack/ai-anthropic\npreact: @tanstack/ai-gemini\npreact: @tanstack/ai-grok\npreact: @tanstack/ai-openrouter\nangular: @tanstack/ai-openai\nangular: @tanstack/ai-anthropic\nangular: @tanstack/ai-gemini\nangular: @tanstack/ai-grok\nangular: @tanstack/ai-openrouter\nvanilla: @tanstack/ai-openai\nvanilla: @tanstack/ai-anthropic\nvanilla: @tanstack/ai-gemini\nvanilla: @tanstack/ai-grok\nvanilla: @tanstack/ai-openrouter\noctane: @tanstack/ai-openai\noctane: @tanstack/ai-anthropic\noctane: @tanstack/ai-gemini\noctane: @tanstack/ai-grok\noctane: @tanstack/ai-openrouter\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat, toHttpResponse } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createWorkersAiChat } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter = createWorkersAiChat(\n  \"@cf/meta/llama-4-scout-17b-16e-instruct\",\n  { binding: env.AI },\n);\n\nconst response = chat({\n  adapter,\n  stream: true,\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello!\" }],\n});\n\nconst httpResponse = toHttpResponse(response);\n```\n\n## Workers AI\n\nThe simplest way to use AI in a Cloudflare Worker. No API keys needed when using the `env.AI` binding.\n\n### Chat\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat, toHttpResponse } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createWorkersAiChat } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter = createWorkersAiChat(\n  \"@cf/meta/llama-4-scout-17b-16e-instruct\",\n  { binding: env.AI },\n);\n\nconst response = chat({\n  adapter,\n  stream: true,\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello!\" }],\n});\n\nconst httpResponse = toHttpResponse(response);\n```\n\n### Chat with REST Credentials\n\nIf you're not running inside a Worker, use account ID and API key instead:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createWorkersAiChat } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\n\nconst adapter = createWorkersAiChat(\n  \"@cf/meta/llama-4-scout-17b-16e-instruct\",\n  {\n    accountId: \"your-account-id\",\n    apiKey: \"your-api-key\",\n  },\n);\n```\n\n### Image Generation\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateImage } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createWorkersAiImage } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter = createWorkersAiImage(\n  \"@cf/stabilityai/stable-diffusion-xl-base-1.0\",\n  { binding: env.AI },\n);\n\nconst result = await generateImage({\n  adapter,\n  prompt: \"a cat in space\",\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.images[0]?.b64Json);\n```\n\n### Transcription (Speech-to-Text)\n\nSupports Whisper and Deepgram models:\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateTranscription } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createWorkersAiTranscription } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env, audioArrayBuffer } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter = createWorkersAiTranscription(\n  \"@cf/openai/whisper-large-v3-turbo\",\n  { binding: env.AI },\n);\n\nconst result = await generateTranscription({\n  adapter,\n  audio: audioArrayBuffer,\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.text);\nconsole.log(result.segments);\n```\n\nSupported transcription models: `@cf/openai/whisper`, `@cf/openai/whisper-tiny-en`, `@cf/openai/whisper-large-v3-turbo`, `@cf/deepgram/nova-3`\n\n### Text-to-Speech\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateSpeech } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createWorkersAiTts } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter = createWorkersAiTts(\"@cf/deepgram/aura-2-en\", {\n  binding: env.AI,\n});\n\nconst result = await generateSpeech({\n  adapter,\n  text: \"Hello world\",\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.audio);\n```\n\n### Summarization\n\n```typescript\nimport { summarize, type AnySummarizeAdapter } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createWorkersAiSummarize } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter: AnySummarizeAdapter = createWorkersAiSummarize(\"@cf/facebook/bart-large-cnn\", {\n  binding: env.AI,\n});\n\nconst result = await summarize({\n  adapter,\n  text: \"Long article here...\",\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.summary);\n```\n\n## AI Gateway\n\nRoute AI requests through Cloudflare's AI Gateway for caching, rate limiting, and unified billing. Supports both Workers AI and third-party providers.\n\n### Workers AI through Gateway\n\n```typescript\nimport { createWorkersAiChat } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter = createWorkersAiChat(\n  \"@cf/meta/llama-4-scout-17b-16e-instruct\",\n  {\n    binding: env.AI.gateway(\"my-gateway-id\"),\n    apiKey: env.WORKERS_AI_TOKEN,\n  },\n);\n```\n\n### Third-Party Providers through Gateway\n\nUse the binding approach (recommended for Cloudflare Workers):\n\n```typescript\nimport {\n  createOpenAiChat,\n  createAnthropicChat,\n  createGeminiChat,\n  createGrokChat,\n  createOpenRouterChat,\n} from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst openai = createOpenAiChat(\"gpt-4o\", {\n  binding: env.AI.gateway(\"my-gateway-id\"),\n});\n\nconst anthropic = createAnthropicChat(\"claude-sonnet-4-5\", {\n  binding: env.AI.gateway(\"my-gateway-id\"),\n});\n\nconst grok = createGrokChat(\"grok-4.3\", {\n  binding: env.AI.gateway(\"my-gateway-id\"),\n});\n\nconst openrouter = createOpenRouterChat(\"openai/gpt-4o\", {\n  binding: env.AI.gateway(\"my-gateway-id\"),\n});\n```\n\nOr use credentials for non-Worker environments:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createOpenAiChat } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\n\nconst adapter = createOpenAiChat(\"gpt-4o\", {\n  accountId: \"your-account-id\",\n  gatewayId: \"your-gateway-id\",\n  cfApiKey: \"your-cf-api-key\",\n  apiKey: \"provider-api-key\",\n});\n```\n\n### Cache Options\n\nBoth binding and credentials modes support cache configuration:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createOpenAiChat } from \"@cloudflare/tanstack-ai\";\nimport { env } from \"./env\";\n\nconst adapter = createOpenAiChat(\"gpt-4o\", {\n  binding: env.AI.gateway(\"my-gateway-id\"),\n  skipCache: false,\n  cacheTtl: 3600,\n  customCacheKey: \"my-key\",\n  metadata: { user: \"test\" },\n});\n```\n\n## Configuration Modes\n\nWorkers AI supports four configuration modes:\n\n| Mode | Config | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| Plain binding | `{ binding: env.AI }` | Direct access, no gateway |\n| Plain REST | `{ accountId, apiKey }` | REST API, no gateway |\n| Gateway binding | `{ binding: env.AI.gateway(id) }` | Through AI Gateway via binding |\n| Gateway REST | `{ accountId, gatewayId, ... }` | Through AI Gateway via REST |\n\nThird-party providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Grok, OpenRouter) only support the gateway modes.\n\n## Supported Capabilities\n\n| Provider | Chat | Summarize | Image Gen | Transcription | TTS |\n|----------|------|-----------|-----------|---------------|-----|\n| **Workers AI** | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| **OpenAI** | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| **Anthropic** | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |\n| **Gemini** | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ✅ |\n| **Grok** | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |\n| **OpenRouter** | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |\n\n## Environment Variables\n\nFor the REST credential path (outside of Cloudflare Workers):\n\n```bash\nCLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=your-account-id\nCLOUDFLARE_API_KEY=your-api-key\n```\n\nWhen using the `env.AI` binding inside a Worker, no environment variables are needed.\n\n## API Reference\n\n### Workers AI\n\n- `createWorkersAiChat(model, config)` — Chat and structured output\n- `createWorkersAiImage(model, config)` — Image generation\n- `createWorkersAiTranscription(model, config)` — Speech-to-text (Whisper, Deepgram)\n- `createWorkersAiTts(model, config)` — Text-to-speech (Deepgram Aura)\n- `createWorkersAiSummarize(model, config)` — Summarization (BART-large-CNN)\n\n### Gateway Providers\n\n- `createOpenAiChat(model, config)` / `createOpenAiSummarize` / `createOpenAiImage` / `createOpenAiTranscription` / `createOpenAiTts`\n- `createAnthropicChat(model, config)` / `createAnthropicSummarize`\n- `createGeminiChat(model, config)` / `createGeminiSummarize` / `createGeminiImage` / `createGeminiTts`\n- `createGrokChat(model, config)` / `createGrokSummarize` / `createGrokImage`\n- `createOpenRouterChat(model, config)` / `createOpenRouterSummarize` / `createOpenRouterImage`\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- [Cloudflare Workers AI](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/) — Workers AI documentation\n- [Cloudflare AI Gateway](https://developers.cloudflare.com/ai-gateway/) — AI Gateway documentation\n- [GitHub Repository](https://github.com/cloudflare/ai) — Source code and issues\n- [Streaming Guide](../chat/streaming) — Learn about streaming responses\n- [Tools Guide](../tools/tools) — Learn about tool calling\n"}
